---@field deliveryRateType? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DeliveryControlDeliveryRateTypeEnum|string Output only. Specifies how the impression delivery will be paced.
---@field companionDeliveryType? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DeliveryControlCompanionDeliveryTypeEnum|string Output only. Specifies roadblocking in a main companion lineitem.
---@field creativeRotationType? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DeliveryControlCreativeRotationTypeEnum|string Output only. Specifies strategy to use for selecting a creative when multiple creatives of the same size are available.

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DeliveryControlCompanionDeliveryTypeEnum "COMPANION_DELIVERY_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"DELIVERY_OPTIONAL"|"DELIVERY_AT_LEAST_ONE"|"DELIVERY_ALL"

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DeliveryControlCreativeRotationTypeEnum "CREATIVE_ROTATION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"ROTATION_EVEN"|"ROTATION_OPTIMIZED"|"ROTATION_MANUAL"|"ROTATION_SEQUENTIAL"

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DeliveryControlDeliveryRateTypeEnum "DELIVERY_RATE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"EVENLY"|"FRONT_LOADED"|"AS_FAST_AS_POSSIBLE"

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DeliveryControlRoadblockingTypeEnum "ROADBLOCKING_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"ONLY_ONE"|"ONE_OR_MORE"|"AS_MANY_AS_POSSIBLE"|"ALL_ROADBLOCK"|"CREATIVE_SET"

---A generic empty message that you can re-use to avoid defining duplicated empty messages in your APIs. A typical example is to use it as the request or the response type of an API method. For instance: service Foo { rpc Bar(google.protobuf.Empty) returns (google.protobuf.Empty); }
---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.Empty

---A finalized deal is a snapshot of the deal when both buyer and seller accept the deal. The buyer or seller can update the deal after it's been finalized and renegotiate on the deal targeting, terms and other fields, while at the same time the finalized snapshot of the deal can still be retrieved using this API. The finalized deal contains a copy of the deal as it existed when most recently finalized, as well as fields related to deal serving such as pause/resume status, RTB metrics, and more.
---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.FinalizedDeal
---@field deal? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.Deal A copy of the Deal made upon finalization. During renegotiation, this will reflect the last finalized deal before renegotiation was initiated.
---@field readyToServe? boolean Whether the Programmatic Guaranteed deal is ready for serving.
---@field dealPausingInfo? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DealPausingInfo Information related to deal pausing for the deal.
---@field name? string The resource name of the finalized deal. Format: `buyers/{accountId}/finalizedDeals/{finalizedDealId}`
---@field dealServingStatus? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.FinalizedDealDealServingStatusEnum Serving status of the deal.
---@field rtbMetrics? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.RtbMetrics Real-time bidding metrics for this deal.

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.FinalizedDealDealServingStatusEnum "DEAL_SERVING_STATUS_UNSPECIFIED"|"ACTIVE"|"ENDED"|"PAUSED_BY_BUYER"|"PAUSED_BY_SELLER"

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.FinalizedDealList gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.FinalizedDeal[]

