---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.FirstPartyMobileApplicationTargeting
---@field excludedAppIds? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringList A list of application IDs to be excluded.
---@field targetedAppIds? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringList A list of application IDs to be included.

