---@field excludedSensitiveCategoryIds? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringList Output only. The sensitive content category label IDs excluded. Refer to this file https://storage.googleapis.com/adx-rtb-dictionaries/content-labels.txt for category IDs.
---@field inventoryTypeTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.InventoryTypeTargeting Output only. Inventory type targeting information.
---@field videoTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.VideoTargeting Output only. Video targeting information.
---@field daypartTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.DayPartTargeting Daypart targeting information.
---@field inventorySizeTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.InventorySizeTargeting Output only. Inventory sizes to be included/excluded.
---@field verticalTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.CriteriaTargeting Output only. The verticals included or excluded as defined in https://developers.google.com/authorized-buyers/rtb/downloads/publisher-verticals
---@field userListTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.CriteriaTargeting Buyer user list targeting information. User lists can be uploaded using https://developers.google.com/authorized-buyers/rtb/bulk-uploader.
