---@field operatingSystemCriteria? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.CriteriaTargeting IDs of operating systems to be included/excluded.

---Represents targeting about where the ads can appear, for example, certain sites or mobile applications. Different placement targeting types will be logically OR'ed.
---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackagePlacementTargeting
---@field includedMobileAppCategoryTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringList Optional. The list of targeted mobile app categories.
---@field mobileAppTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringTargetingDimension Optional. The list of targeted or excluded mobile application IDs that publishers own. Currently, only Android and Apple apps are supported. Android App ID, for example, com.google.android.apps.maps, can be found in Google Play Store URL. iOS App ID (which is a number) can be found at the end of iTunes store URL. First party mobile applications is either included or excluded.
---@field uriTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringTargetingDimension Optional. The list of targeted or excluded URLs. The domains should have the http/https stripped (for example, google.com), and can contain a max of 5 paths per url.

---Represents targeting about publisher provided signals. Different publisher provided signals types will be logically OR'ed.
---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackagePublisherProvidedSignalsTargeting
---@field contentTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.TaxonomyTargeting Optional. The list of targeted or excluded content IDs. Based off of IAB Content Taxonomy version 2.2 (https://github.com/InteractiveAdvertisingBureau/Taxonomies/blob/main/Content%20Taxonomies/Content%20Taxonomy%202.2.tsv)
---@field audienceTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.TaxonomyTargeting Optional. The list of targeted or excluded audience IDs. Based off of IAB Audience Taxonomy version 1.1 (https://github.com/InteractiveAdvertisingBureau/Taxonomies/blob/main/Audience%20Taxonomies/Audience%20Taxonomy%201.1.tsv)
---@field videoAndAudioSignalsTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringTargetingDimension Optional. The list of targeted and excluded video and audio signals IDs. These are additional signals supported by publisher provided signals.

---Targeting criteria for curated and auction packages.
---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargeting
---@field minimumPredictedViewabilityPercentage? string Optional. The targeted minimum predicted viewability percentage. This value must be a multiple of 10 between 10 and 90 (inclusive). For example, 10 is valid, but 0, 15, and 100 are not. A value of 10 means that the configuration will only match adslots for which we predict at least 10% viewability. An unset value indicates inventory will be targeted regardless of predicted viewability.
---@field includedOpenMeasurementTypes? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedOpenMeasurementTypesItemEnumList Optional. The list of targeted open measurement types. If empty, inventory will be targeted regardless of Open Measurement support.
---@field includedDeviceTypes? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedDeviceTypesItemEnumList Optional. The list of included device types to target. If empty, all device types are targeted.
---@field languageTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringTargetingDimension Optional. The languages to target. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of language. See https://developers.google.com/google-ads/api/data/codes-formats#languages for the list of supported language codes.
---@field geoTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.CriteriaTargeting Optional. The geo criteria IDs to be included or excluded as defined in https://storage.googleapis.com/adx-rtb-dictionaries/geo-table.csv. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of geo.
---@field includedNativeInventoryTypes? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedNativeInventoryTypesItemEnumList Optional. The targeted native inventory types. If empty, inventory will be targeted regardless of native inventory type.
---@field includedRewardedType? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedRewardedTypeEnum|string Optional. The targeted rewarded type. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of rewarded type.
---@field verticalTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.CriteriaTargeting Optional. The verticals included or excluded as defined in https://developers.google.com/authorized-buyers/rtb/downloads/publisher-verticals. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of vertical.
---@field includedDataSegments? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringList Optional. The active data segments to be targeted. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of data segments. Format: `curators/{account_id}/dataSegments/{data_segment_id}`
---@field includedRestrictedCategories? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedRestrictedCategoriesItemEnumList Optional. The list of targeted restricted categories. If empty, inventory will be targeted regardless of restricted categories.
---@field publisherProvidedSignalsTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackagePublisherProvidedSignalsTargeting Optional. The publisher provided signals to target. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of publisher provided signals.
---@field placementTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackagePlacementTargeting Optional. Placement targeting information, for example, URL, mobile applications.
---@field includedAdSizes? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.AdSizeList Optional. The list of ad sizes to target. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of ad size. Curated packages supports `PIXEL` and `INTERSTITIAL` ad sizes.
---@field videoTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageVideoTargeting Optional. Video specific targeting criteria.
---@field publisherTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringTargetingDimension Optional. The targeted publishers. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of publisher. Publishers are identified by their publisher ID from ads.txt / app-ads.txt. See https://iabtechlab.com/ads-txt/ and https://iabtechlab.com/app-ads-txt/ for more details.
---@field includedEnvironment? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedEnvironmentEnum|string Optional. The environment to target. If unspecified, all environments are targeted.
---@field includedCreativeFormat? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedCreativeFormatEnum|string Optional. The creative format to target. If unset, all creative markup types are targeted.
---@field minimumPredictedClickThroughRatePercentageMillis? string Optional. The targeted minimum predicted click through rate, ranging in values [10, 10000] (0.01% - 10%). A value of 50 means that the configuration will only match adslots for which we predict at least 0.05% click through rate. An unset value indicates inventory will be targeted regardless of predicted click through rate.
---@field includedAuthorizedSellerStatuses? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedAuthorizedSellerStatusesItemEnumList Optional. The included list of targeted authorized seller statuses. If empty, inventory will be targeted regardless of seller status.
---@field includedAcceleratedMobilePageType? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedAcceleratedMobilePageTypeEnum|string Optional. The targeted accelerated mobile page type. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of AMP status.

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedAcceleratedMobilePageTypeEnum "ACCELERATED_MOBILE_PAGE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"ACCELERATED_MOBILE_PAGE_TYPE_NON_AMP"|"ACCELERATED_MOBILE_PAGE_TYPE_AMP"|"ACCELERATED_MOBILE_PAGE_TYPE_AMP_STORY"

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PackageTargetingIncludedAuthorizedSellerStatusesItemEnum "AUTHORIZED_SELLER_STATUS_UNSPECIFIED"|"AUTHORIZED_SELLER_STATUS_DIRECT"|"AUTHORIZED_SELLER_STATUS_RESELLER"

