---The values in the publisher profile are supplied by the publisher. All fields are not filterable unless stated otherwise.
---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PublisherProfile
---@field publisherCode? string A unique identifying code for the seller. This value is the same for all of the seller's parent and child publisher profiles. Can be used to filter the response of the publisherProfiles.list method.
---@field pitchStatement? string Statement explaining what's unique about publisher's business, and why buyers should partner with the publisher.
---@field name? string Name of the publisher profile. Format: `buyers/{buyer}/publisherProfiles/{publisher_profile}`
---@field mediaKitUrl? string URL to additional marketing and sales materials.
---@field samplePageUrl? string URL to a sample content page.
---@field programmaticDealsContact? string Contact information for programmatic deals. This is free text entered by the publisher and may include information like names, phone numbers and email addresses.
---@field mobileApps? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PublisherProfileMobileApplicationList The list of apps represented in this publisher profile. Empty if this is a parent profile.
---@field isParent? boolean Indicates if this profile is the parent profile of the seller. A parent profile represents all the inventory from the seller, as opposed to child profile that is created to brand a portion of inventory. One seller has only one parent publisher profile, and can have multiple child profiles. See https://support.google.com/admanager/answer/6035806 for details. Can be used to filter the response of the publisherProfiles.list method by setting the filter to "is_parent: true".
---@field audienceDescription? string Description on the publisher's audience.
---@field directDealsContact? string Contact information for direct reservation deals. This is free text entered by the publisher and may include information like names, phone numbers and email addresses.
---@field domains? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringList The list of domains represented in this publisher profile. Empty if this is a parent profile. These are top private domains, meaning that these will not contain a string like "photos.google.co.uk/123", but will instead contain "google.co.uk". Can be used to filter the response of the publisherProfiles.list method.
---@field overview? string Overview of the publisher.
---@field topHeadlines? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.StringList Up to three key metrics and rankings. For example, "#1 Mobile News Site for 20 Straight Months".
---@field logoUrl? string A Google public URL to the logo for this publisher profile. The logo is stored as a PNG, JPG, or GIF image.
---@field displayName? string Display name of the publisher profile. Can be used to filter the response of the publisherProfiles.list method.

---@alias gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PublisherProfileList gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PublisherProfile[]

---A mobile application that contains a external app ID, name, and app store.
---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PublisherProfileMobileApplication
---@field appStore? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PublisherProfileMobileApplicationAppStoreEnum The app store the app belongs to. Can be used to filter the response of the publisherProfiles.list method.
