---@class gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.SendRfpBuyersProposalsRequest
---@field geoTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.CriteriaTargeting Geo criteria IDs to be targeted. Refer to Geo tables.
---@field estimatedGrossSpend? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.Money Specified by buyers in request for proposal (RFP) to notify publisher the total estimated spend for the proposal. Publishers will receive this information and send back proposed deals accordingly.
---@field inventorySizeTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.InventorySizeTargeting Inventory sizes to be targeted. Only PIXEL inventory size type is supported.
---@field preferredDealTerms? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.PreferredDealTerms The terms for preferred deals.
---@field publisherProfile? string Required. The profile of the publisher who will receive this RFP in the format: `buyers/{accountId}/publisherProfiles/{publisherProfileId}`.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the proposal being created by this RFP.
---@field programmaticGuaranteedTerms? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.ProgrammaticGuaranteedTerms The terms for programmatic guaranteed deals.
---@field flightEndTime? string Required. Proposed flight end time of the RFP. A timestamp in RFC3339 UTC "Zulu" format. Note that the specified value will be truncated to a granularity of one second.
---@field flightStartTime? string Required. Proposed flight start time of the RFP. A timestamp in RFC3339 UTC "Zulu" format. Note that the specified value will be truncated to a granularity of one second.
---@field buyerContacts? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1alpha.ContactList Contact information for the buyer.
---@field note? string A message that is sent to the publisher. Maximum length is 1024 characters.
---@field client? string If the current buyer is sending the RFP on behalf of its client, use this field to specify the name of the client in the format: `buyers/{accountId}/clients/{clientAccountid}`.
---@field buyer string Required. The current buyer who is sending the RFP in the format: `buyers/{accountId}`.

